{{!
    @template tool_vae/scope_page

    The page "Hors de mon activité", below its heading: what a mark is, whether the function is open, the error of the
    last sending, the marks already said or one sentence, then the form to say one (or a notification when no record is
    imported) and the way back to the dossier.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\scope_page. The template holds no logic. Every
    text and address is escaped (double braces), except six keys of HTML made by the core or by another template (triple
    braces): closedhtml, errorhtml and noframeworkhtml, notifications of the core ($output->notification()); tablehtml, the
    table drawn by the template tool_vae/table; headinghtml, a heading of the core ($output->heading()); formhtml, the form
    of the core (moodleform::render()), drawn once.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * intro - string, what the page is for
    * sentence - string, what a mark is
    * closedhtml - false, or HTML: the notification that the function is not open
    * errorhtml - false, or HTML: the error of the last sending
    * none - false, or a string: the sentence drawn when nothing is said
    * tablehtml - false, or HTML: the table of the marks
    * noframeworkhtml - false, or HTML: the notification drawn when no record is imported
    * headinghtml - false, or HTML: the heading above the form
    * formhtml - false, or HTML: the form to say a mark
    * back - {url, label}: the way back to the dossier

    Example context (json):
    {
        "intro": "If a competency of a record does not belong to your activity, you can say so.",
        "sentence": "This mark is the candidate's own word about their activity. It exempts from nothing.",
        "closedhtml": false,
        "errorhtml": false,
        "none": false,
        "tablehtml": "<table class=\"generaltable\"><tbody><tr><td>RNCP1-C1 — Welcome</td></tr></tbody></table>",
        "noframeworkhtml": false,
        "headinghtml": "<h3>Say that a competency is outside my activity</h3>",
        "formhtml": "<form method=\"post\" action=\"https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/scope.php\"></form>",
        "back": {"url": "https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/dossier.php?userid=7", "label": "Back to the dossier"}
    }
}}
<p>{{intro}}</p>
<p class="font-italic">{{sentence}}</p>
{{#closedhtml}}
{{{closedhtml}}}
{{/closedhtml}}
{{#errorhtml}}
{{{errorhtml}}}
{{/errorhtml}}
{{#none}}
<p>{{none}}</p>
{{/none}}
{{#tablehtml}}
{{{tablehtml}}}
{{/tablehtml}}
{{#noframeworkhtml}}
{{{noframeworkhtml}}}
{{/noframeworkhtml}}
{{#headinghtml}}
{{{headinghtml}}}
{{/headinghtml}}
{{#formhtml}}
{{{formhtml}}}
{{/formhtml}}
{{#back}}
<div class="mt-3"><a href="{{url}}">{{label}}</a></div>
{{/back}}
